      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Using a slash for this would be wonderful for organization as well, especially when using lots of VRC-provided parameters. Something along the lines of `VRC/Earmuffs`, `VRC/IsLocal`, `VRC/Voice`, `VRC/GestureLeft`, etc. would be very nice, perhaps even as aliases for current parameters.",
